From 5ee4beb90b6af3a8d789d60dc9c1b96b3ce9c98d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LyraCalc OS <lyracalc-os@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] ili9488: status bar overlay device, faster refresh, no
 snow at power-on

- /dev/fb_overlay: a program writes N lines of RGB565; the driver always
  sends them to the top of the panel instead of the framebuffer content
- refresh rate 150 fps by default, p_fps= to override
- p_hwswap=0 selects the CPU byte swap path
- display on only after the screen was cleared
- SPI clock limit raised to 100 MHz (rockchip SPI and panel node)
